          "docs": "Move a provider credentialing workflow to denied status.<br/><br/>\n      Denial Criteria<br/>\n      - The workflow must exist and be accessible to the current organization and user.<br/>\n      - The workflow can only be denied by Medical Director or Provisional Approver.<br/>\n      - The workflow must be in state (PSV ready, Tabled, Hold for Cred Comm) that allows the \n        requested transition.<br/>\n      - Once the workflow is in the denied state, it cannot be reverted by any user besides S"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Table Provider Credentialing Workflow",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "https://ng-api-production.certifyos.com/v2/credentialing-workflows/:id/steps/move-to-tabled",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "organization-id",
